# Hits: Edit / Append / Insert (no arguments) on a dataset, the routine then writes a field of
# that dataset and never calls Post, Cancel or CheckBrowseMode on it (12, 18, 27, 34).
# Non-hits: Post / Cancel / CheckBrowseMode present (also through with), Edit with no field
# write, a list Insert(0, 'x'), a Post on ANOTHER dataset does not excuse the first (34 is a hit).
dataset-edit-without-post 12
dataset-edit-without-post 18
dataset-edit-without-post 27
dataset-edit-without-post 34
!dataset-edit-without-post 36
!dataset-edit-without-post 43
!dataset-edit-without-post 50
!dataset-edit-without-post 64
!dataset-edit-without-post 72
!dataset-edit-without-post 80
!dataset-edit-without-post 85
!dataset-edit-without-post 91
